UnitRootLocalAdapter::constructor
├── when rootMessageOrchestrator is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when leafMessageOrchestrator is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when rootMessageOrchestrator and leafMessageOrchestrator have the same address
│   └── it should revert with IdenticalOrchestrators
└── when all inputs are valid
    ├── it should set REMOTE_CHAIN_ID to block.chainid
    ├── it should set ROOT_MESSAGE_ORCHESTRATOR to _rootMessageOrchestrator
    └── it should set LEAF_MESSAGE_ORCHESTRATOR to _leafMessageOrchestrator

UnitRootLocalAdapter::sendMessage
├── when msg value is nonzero
│   └── it should revert with NoFeeRequired
└── given msg value is zero
    ├── when message sender is the root message orchestrator
    │   └── it should call route on LEAF_MESSAGE_ORCHESTRATOR with REMOTE_CHAIN_ID and _message
    ├── when message sender is the leaf message orchestrator
    │   └── it should call route on ROOT_MESSAGE_ORCHESTRATOR with REMOTE_CHAIN_ID and _message
    └── when message sender is not a registered orchestrator
        └── it should revert with CallerNotOrchestrator

UnitRootLocalAdapter::quoteMessage
└── when called with any inputs
    └── it should return zero

UnitRootLocalAdapter::handle
└── when called with any inputs
    └── it should revert with NotSupported

UnitRootLocalAdapter::setRemoteAdapter
└── when called with any inputs
    └── it should revert with NotSupported
